From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: athexweb3 <athexweb3@nirapod.org>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:28:24 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] armv8a: add EXTR and the bit-field instructions
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Port of jasmin-lang/jasmin#1617 (head 00e7e972eeb6, by Benjamin Gregoire and
Côme Le Breton) to the instruction descriptors of dd35a2bb, to be replaced by
upstream's revision of the pull request. The instructions, their argument
kinds, printing, tests and changelog entry are those of the pull request.
The descriptors give a total semantics with the same safety conditions as
before; the assertions in the semantics of BFC, BFI, BFXIL, SBFX and UBFX,
which those conditions imply and are implied by, are removed with the
lemmas that related them.

Signed-off-by: athexweb3 <athexweb3@nirapod.org>
